# What `docker build` may read. Everything is refused, then what the build needs is let
# through, one line each: a local .env, a dump of .migration/, the git history or the tests
# never reach the builder, even under a name nobody thought of.
#
# The only files of scripts/ and tests/ let through are the import and the fake Strapi source of
# the bench, which is fictional. They stay for the import that runs in the container of the site
# (ticket 233); the pre-production that used them is gone (ticket 232).
#
# The list is frozen by tests/ci/ci-guardrails.test.ts: a new line is added there too.
*
!package.json
!bun.lock
!patches
!next.config.ts
!tsconfig.json
!postcss.config.json
!src
!public
!scripts/migration/import
!tests/support/source-strapi/creation.ts
!tests/support/source-strapi/data.ts
!tests/support/source-strapi/images.ts
!tests/support/source-strapi/schema.ts
!tests/fixtures/import/bench-decisions.json
!tests/fixtures/import/bench-reference.json
